@SEC name="Reported Issues"
@NOTE text="Apparently the authentication module has a race condition during token refresh."
@NOTE text="I heard from DevOps that the connection pool was already maxed out."
@NOTE text="Supposedly the new release fixes the memory leak but nobody has confirmed it yet."
